\**{c=red:Note: }** Completing this quest will trigger the next quest for Lilisette's trust. If you are doing {p:Rhapsodies of Vana'diel}, do not leave without completing the next quest, {q:A Forbidden Reunion|A Forbidden Reunion|A Forbidden Reunion}.{br} **{c=red:Note: }** **If you have already completed this quest and are trying to fight {p:Cait Sith} again, you must use the walkthrough from {q:The Dawn Also Rises|The Dawn Also Rises|The Dawn Also Rises} instead.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Enter {p:Walk of Echoes} for a cutscene.
** It does not matter from which area you enter. This flags the quest.
* Find 3 remnants of latent energy in the the same locations as 3 of the {@k} dawndrops from {M:Fork in the Road|Fork in the Road|Fork in the Road}:
** {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)}, there is an unlabeled (blank) point of interest at the bottom of the ramp down from the campaign warp on the border of G-9 and H-9. This gives you the temporary {@k} {k:Breath of dawn}.
*** The C.A (Campaign Arbiter) Warp {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} is the fastest way.
** {z:East Ronfaure (S)}, northwest corner of H-7 by a tree alongside the river. Use the Eastgate exit. Gives you a second {@k} {k:Breath of dawn}.
** {z:Jugner Forest (S)}, southeast corner of **Lake Mechieume** at the border of H-6 and I-6. This gives you a third {@k} {k:Breath of dawn}.
*** {p:Survival Guide} warp to {z:East Ronfaure (S)} then head east in Jugner Forest (S) is the fastest way for this step.
* Take these three Key Items to {p:Walk of Echoes} through the {z:Grauberg (S)} {p:Veridical Conflux} (F-5) or, if you've opened it with {p:Voidwatch} quests, the {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} {p:Veridical Conflux} (J-9) close to survival guide teleport.
** Fastest way is through {z:Rolanberry Fields} entrance to {p:Walk of Echoes} via {k:Lightsworm}.
** The C.A (Campaign Arbiter) Warp {z:Grauberg (S)} will bring you closest to reach the {p:Witchfire Glen} Veridical Conflux at (F-5) if you have little to no progress with {p:Voidwatch}.
* Check the **Ornate Door** three times. Once for a cutscene, a second time for a shorter cutscene (introducing the fight), and a third time to begin the actual fight.

=3 Champion of the Dawn
\**Note:** you do not have to be a {p:Summoner} when completing the quest, and a party of up to 6 may enter the battlefield. Like the other {p:Avatar} fight rewards, the player can choose three different pieces of gear, or Gil instead of access to the Avatar.
* You fight {p:Cait Sith}.
* The fight is trivial at 99. {p:Trusts} may be summoned.
* {p:Cait Sith} will use -ja spells and may put the party to sleep with **Mewing Lullaby** (as well as casting other enfeebling spells).
* Upon completion of the fight the Quest is complete, and you may choose from the list of rewards.
** There is also a final option when making your reward selection, "For Lilisette to..." The option doesn't do anything except for a small statement, and forces you to pick something else. You are only allowed to choose it once and it is not available on subsequent fights.
* If you lose the fight, you will need to check the shining **Regal Pawprint** just outside the **Ornate Door**, then return to any one of the shining spots from the previous Mission, then come back to the **Ornate Door** and retry.

